## Objective
- Act as autonomous bug-bounty agent per `skills/AGENT.md`: discover and test all UI routes/APIs on authorized target `account.ui.com` (from `data/targets.txt`), one route at a time, covering client-side and server-side bugs, and write findings/progress into `result/`.
- Create two test accounts if possible; otherwise test only unauthenticated endpoints. Notify Discord webhook (in `data/targets.txt`) on confirmed vuln.

## Important Details
- Repo root: `/home/runner/work/aaii-aautomattionn/aaii-aautomattionn`. CWD is repo root.
- Scope decision: `account.ui.com` only. `sso.ui.com` is a different subdomain; treated as the app backend required to exercise account.ui.com (documented assumption in `result/scope.md`); do NOT pivot to unrelated `sso.ui.com` endpoints or other `ui.com` hosts.
- Confirmed-vuln classes allowed (AGENT.md §9): only XSS, CSTI, IDOR/BAC, open redirect. Secret exposure must be documented but excluded from `result/confirmed-vuln.txt`.
- `creds/test-account.txt` = byteplus/console.byteplus.com creds, NOT usable for account.ui.com. `creds/` is read-only during run; save any new creds to `result/`.
- Tools: `curl 8.18.0`, `git 2.56.0`, `node v22.23.4`, `python3 3.14.4`, `Google Chrome 156.0.8078.73`. `rg` NOT installed (use grep/python/node). Chrome DevTools MCP up at `http://127.0.0.1:9222`, page id 2 = `https://account.ui.com/register`.
- `account.ui.com` resolves 18.238.109.21, HTTP 200. CSP has `script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' ... *.ui.com *.ubnt.com`; `frame-ancestors 'self' *.ui.com uic.uidev.tools *.uic.uidev.tools`; `x-frame-options: SAMEORIGIN`.
- API bases in bundle: `sso` = `https://sso.ui.com` on `*.ui.com` else `https://sso.ubnt.com`; `accountBE` = `https://account.svc.ui.com`; `geo` = `https://geo.svc.ui.com`.
- Key endpoints: `POST /api/sso/v2/users` (createAccount), `POST /api/sso/v1/login/email`, `POST /api/sso/v1/login`, `POST /api/sso/v1/login/2fa`, `GET /api/sso/v1/user/self`, `POST /api/sso/v1/password`, `POST /api/sso/v1/verify/password`, `POST /api/sso/v1/verify/verification-code`, `POST /api/sso/v1/verify`, `GET /api/sso/v1/search/username|email`, `POST /api/sso/v2/password-strength`, `POST /api/sso/v1/idp/login-result`, `POST /api/sso/v1/logout`, `GET /api/sso/v1/legal`, `GET /api/sso/v1/account-chooser`.
- Registration payload: `{captcha, site_key, email, username, password, curr_privacy_rev, curr_terms_rev, newsletter:{announcements,unifi,uisp}}`; site_key = `6LfyUkwpAAAAAJ6-mN1q_IAe0bM8pit_lxc0anmv`.
- Exposed secrets in bundle (document, not confirmed-vuln class): `GOOGLE_RECAPTCHA_SECRET_HIGH_RISK_TEST=6LdaPy4jAAAAAEWMtLxQ8T2gnkeAK6viQVjAnk1v`, `GOOGLE_RECAPTCHA_SECRET_MEDIUM_RISK_TEST=6LfKMy4jAAAAAJarRZift6kKBImrh6JA4-TV3ABc`, `GOOGLE_RECAPTCHA_SECRET_SCORE=6LfGZXojAAAAAEtQpgRueRxoFwnjwe58b1exZGsS`, `GOOGLE_RECAPTCHA_SECRET_CHALLENGE=6LdWhNglAAAAAJB_RK6EWYVnSVyrohxdwy9WEkP8`, `GOOGLE_MAPS_SECRET=AIzaSyBE3JpOF9gNSsb83dpZKLUqFkmBAsPr0-w`, TapPay `appKey=app_bP4RT1nl1UhcVo9263eWSV1gj9vO8LYph8umlcwm9zP3dmt3hkbOePPkU97P`, Ironclad `accessId=b30c676d-0e21-4985-9ff5-e9b501d05c78`, `SEND_SAFELY_DZ_ID=ffj-VzYWGCsmGlpsNAiab0XBnIapToICjLMO2bwy2Eg`. Stripe `pk_live_*` are publishable/public.
- Open-redirect analysis so far: `DQ()` parses `redirect`/`innerRedirect` from URL; `MC()` allowlists `hostname.split('.').slice(-2)` in `ui.com`/`ubnt.com`/`uisp.com`; `Wpe()` validates innerRedirect (not yet inspected). `CQ` does `window.location.replace(redirect)` after login. `return_url` validated by `MC` (`r_t`). Nav helper `fme`/`resolveExternal` opens external in `_blank` + noopener. No exploitable open redirect found yet.
- `/idp/login-result` (~6440400–6441033) reads `code`/`state`, calls completeIdpLogin, then `window.location.replace(next)` — server-controlled `next`, untested.
