## Objective
- Act as autonomous bug-bounty agent per `skills/AGENT.md`: discover and test all UI routes/APIs on authorized target `account.ui.com` (from `data/targets.txt`), one route at a time, covering client-side and server-side bugs, and write findings/progress into `result/`.
- Create two test accounts if possible; otherwise test only unauthenticated endpoints. Notify Discord webhook (in `data/targets.txt`) only on a confirmed vuln in the allowed classes.

## Important Details
- Repo root: `/home/runner/work/aaii-aautomattionn/aaii-aautomattionn`; CWD is repo root.
- Scope: `account.ui.com` only. `sso.ui.com`/`account.svc.ui.com`/`geo.svc.ui.com` treated as the app backend required to exercise account.ui.com (assumption documented in `result/scope.md`); do NOT pivot to unrelated endpoints or other `ui.com` hosts.
