- Tools: `curl 8.18.0`, `git 2.56.0`, `node v22.23.4`, `python3 3.14.4`, Chrome 156.0.8078.73. `rg` NOT installed (use grep/python/node). Chrome DevTools MCP at `http://127.0.0.1:9222`, page id 2.
- `data/targets.txt` is 3247 bytes; read but truncated in context — Discord webhook URL not captured. Re-read fully if notification needed.
- `account.ui.com` resolves 18.238.109.21, HTTP 200. CSP: `script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' ... *.ui.com *.ubnt.com`; `frame-ancestors 'self' *.ui.com uic.uidev.tools *.uic.uidev.tools`; `x-frame-options: SAMEORIGIN`.
- API bases in bundle: `sso` = `https://sso.ui.com` on `*.ui.com` else `https://sso.ubnt.com`; `accountBE` = `https://account.svc.ui.com`; `geo` = `https://geo.svc.ui.com`; `msp` = `https://fabric.svc.ui.com`; `storeBE` = `https://ecomm.svc.ui.com`.
- Corrected endpoint mappings (from bundle ~5,014,300 / ~734,000): `_C`=POST, `vC`=PUT, `gC`=PATCH, `hC`=GET, `yC`=DELETE.
  - `sendResetPasswordEmail` → `POST /api/sso/v1/password/{email}` (body `{user,site_key,captcha}`)
  - `resetPassword` → `PUT /api/sso/v1/verify/password/{uuid}` with `{password}`
  - `verifyRegistration` → `PUT /api/sso/v1/verify/verification-code/{uuid}`
  - resend verify → `PUT /api/sso/v1/verify/{email|userid}/{username}` with `{captcha,site_key}`
  - `checkEmail` → `GET /api/sso/v1/search/email/{email}`; `checkUsername` → `GET /api/sso/v1/search/username/{username}`
  - `idpLoginResult` → `POST /api/sso/v1/idp/login-result`
  - `loginUserCheck` → `POST /api/sso/v1/login/email` with `{user, return_to: window.location.href, remember_me}`
- Registration payload: `{captcha, site_key, email, username, password, curr_privacy_rev, curr_terms_rev, newsletter:{announcements,unifi,uisp}}`; site_key `Jzt = 6LfGZXojAAAAAEtQpgRueRxoFwnjwe58b1exZGsS` (score) / `qzt = 6LdWhNglAAAAAJB_RK6EWYVnSVyrohxdwy9WEkP8` (challenge).
- Redirect/nav primitives:
  - `Rpe=['ubnt.com','ui.com','uisp.com']`; `MC(e)` requires `http(s)` + `hostname.split('.').slice(-2).join('.')` in `Rpe`.
  - `Wpe(e)` allows only `/login`, `/register`, `/reset-password`, `/switch`, `/backups`, `/payments`, `/subscriptions`, `/invoices`, `/profile`, `/account`, `/security`, `/billing`, `/requests`, `/supportform-uisp` (and sub-paths); rejects `//` and `\`.
  - `DQ(url)` parses `redirect`/`innerRedirect` and validates via `MC`/`Wpe`; `CQ()` does `window.location.replace(redirect)` only if validated, else `navigate(innerRedirect || '/')`.
  - `S7e(window.location)` guard: private + unauth → `/login?innerRedirect=<encoded path+search>` only when pathname passes `Wpe`, else `/login`.
  - `fme()` same-origin paths use React Router; only cross-origin `http(s)` URLs open externally via `window.open(...,'noopener,noreferrer')`.
- Exposed bundle config classification: `GOOGLE_RECAPTCHA_SECRET_SCORE`/`_CHALLENGE` are actually reCAPTCHA **site keys** used client-side (`grecaptcha.enterprise` + `site_key` field); `HIGH_RISK_TEST`/`MEDIUM_RISK_TEST` are unused config constants (87 duplicated config copies, no usage). `GOOGLE_MAPS_SECRET=AIzaSyBE3JpOF9gNSsb83dpZKLUqFkmBAsPr0-w` is referer-restricted (`REQUEST_DENIED`). Stripe `pk_live_*`, TapPay `appKey`, Ironclad accessId/groupKey, SendSafely DZ ID, Zendesk form key, GA key are publishable/embed IDs by design. No usable secret found.
- Embedded postMessage listener accepts `window.parent` messages if `$he(origin)` = `origin.startsWith('https://') && MC(origin)`; `nge()` returns `'*'` only when `Vw.Prod !== 'prd'` (prod validates ancestor origin).
- No app-level `dangerouslySetInnerHTML`/`innerHTML` sinks with user data (18 hits are React/Radix/html-react-parser internals); CSP blocks `eval`.
- Registration blocked by reCAPTCHA Enterprise challenge; do NOT bypass captcha. Browser shows active `bframe` challenge and disabled "Create Account" button.

