- Open-redirect validation tests (`/switch`, `/login`, `/logout` logic, `DQ`/`MC`/`Wpe`).
- Reflected/DOM XSS tests on `login_hint`, `idp/login-result` `error`/`description`,
  `suspicious/confirm` `token`, and the `msp/idp/setup-result` params.
